The costs is a list of 10, 15, and 20.
The last is the last position of costs.
The best is a list of last plus 2 zeros.
For every step from 2 to last plus 1.
The first is item (step minus 1) of best plus item (step minus 1) of costs.
The second is item (step minus 2) of best plus item (step minus 2) of costs.
If first is less than second, set item step of best to first, otherwise set item step of best to second.

Show item (last plus 1) of best.
